  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XLVIIII} Gif swa he deaðes scyldig ⁊ he cirican geierne, hæbbe his feorh ⁊ bete, swa him ryht wisige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone has commited an offense for which he owes his life and he flees into a church, let him keep his life and make restitution according to how [judgment of] law directs him.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone is liable to the death penalty, and he flees to a church, his life shall be spared and he shall pay such compensation as he is directed [to pay] by legal decision.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif swa sy deaðes scyldig ⁊ he cirican geyrne, hæbbe his feorh ⁊ bete, swa him ryht wisie.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
